{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"fig_banner","type":"text","text":"# ❖ Figma DevMode 스타일 — 족욕기 컴포넌트 시스템 & 스펙 인스펙터\n> **철학**: \"모든 제품을 Variants(변형 컴포넌트)로 취급하고, 속성(Properties)과 DevMode 스펙 인스펙터로 정밀 대조한다.\"","x":0,"y":-220,"width":1600,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"fig_tokens","type":"text","text":"### 📐 Design Tokens & System Constraints\n```yaml\ntokens/dimension:\n  height: 220mm ± 20mm (어르신 무릎 각도 최적화)\n  storage_width: ≤ 150mm (가구 틈새 규격)\ntokens/safety:\n  heater: PTC_Ceramic_Isolated (감전 차단)\n  cable: Detachable_Safety_Plug (발걸림 방지)\ntokens/drain:\n  mechanism: Bottom_Gravity_Drain (허리 부담 0%)\n```","x":0,"y":-50,"width":1050,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fig_group_variants","type":"group","label":"❖ Component Set : Footbath_Variants (5 Types)","x":0,"y":180,"width":1050,"height":780,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"var_1","type":"text","text":"### ❖ Variant: Type=HardShell_Classic\n`❌ Status: Deprecated / Rejected`\n\n**Properties:**\n- hydroImmersion: true\n- weightWithWater: 11.5kg ⚠️ (허리 위험)\n- directDrain: false (들어서 배수)\n- foldable: false\n\n> 💡 **Review**: 만수 무게 초과로 어르신 단독 사용 불가 판정","x":30,"y":240,"width":470,"height":210,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"var_2","type":"text","text":"### ❖ Variant: Type=Folding_Silicone (Selected ⭐)\n`✅ Status: Selected Candidate (with Condition)`\n\n**Properties:**\n- hydroImmersion: true\n- storageThickness: 130mm\n- frameLocking: Required (양옆 락킹 골조 필수)\n- directDrain: true (호스 연결 가능)\n\n> 💡 **Review**: 무골조 모델은 붕괴 화상 위험 ➔ '사이드 락킹' 전제 통과","x":540,"y":240,"width":470,"height":210,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"var_3","type":"text","text":"### ❖ Variant: Type=SolidWood_Hinoki\n`❌ Status: Out of Scope`\n\n**Properties:**\n- hydroImmersion: false (dry heat)\n- footprint: 550x550mm (거실 점유)\n- aroma: true (편백 향)\n- maintenance: Low\n\n> 💡 **Review**: 물에 담그는 족욕 본연의 시원함 결여로 제외","x":30,"y":480,"width":470,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"var_4","type":"text","text":"### ❖ Variant: Type=Steam_Sauna\n`❌ Status: Defect Risk`\n\n**Properties:**\n- hydroImmersion: false (steam mist)\n- waterRequired: 250ml (초경량)\n- cleanability: Poor ⚠️ (노즐 석회 물때)\n- pressureSense: false\n\n> 💡 **Review**: 튜브 물때 세척 불가 및 온수 부력 부재로 탈락","x":540,"y":480,"width":470,"height":210,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"var_5","type":"text","text":"### ❖ Variant: Type=Fabric_Boots\n`❌ Status: Low Performance`\n\n**Properties:**\n- hydroImmersion: false\n- portability: High\n- hydroTherapy: false (단순 발난로)\n- hygiene: Fabric wash difficulty\n\n> 💡 **Review**: 땀 차고 피로 해소 효과 미비로 탈락","x":30,"y":710,"width":980,"height":190,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fig_inspector_group","type":"group","label":"🛠️ Figma Dev Mode : Code & BOM Inspector","x":1100,"y":-50,"width":540,"height":1010,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fig_insp_code","type":"text","text":"### ⚙️ Component Code Inspector\n```json\n{\n  \"component\": \"HardLockingFoldingHydroBath\",\n  \"targetUser\": \"Grandmother (Elderly / Lumbar Safe)\",\n  \"structure\": {\n    \"body\": \"High-Tear-Resistant Silicone + PP\",\n    \"reinforcement\": \"Dual-Side Hard Strut Locking\",\n    \"foldedDimensions\": \"420 x 400 x 140 mm\",\n    \"unfoldedHeight\": \"230 mm\"\n  },\n  \"safety\": {\n    \"heatingUnit\": \"PTC Ceramic (Isolated Water/Power)\",\n    \"powerCable\": \"Detachable Magnetic/Plug (Anti-Trip)\",\n    \"autoShutoff\": \"45min Timer & Dry-Run Sensor\"\n  },\n  \"drainage\": {\n    \"type\": \"Bottom Gravity Valve\",\n    \"accessory\": \"1.2m Extension Drain Hose\"\n  }\n}\n```","x":1125,"y":10,"width":490,"height":450,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"fig_insp_bom","type":"text","text":"### 📦 BOM (Bill of Materials) 구매 체크리스트\n\n- [x] **하단 드레인 호스 일체형**: 물통 들지 않고 화장실 하수구로 바로 배수\n- [x] **사이드 하드 락킹 골조**: 발 디뎠을 때 실리콘 무너짐 방지 지지대\n- [x] **분리형 착탈 코드**: 물 채우고 비울 때 선 끌림 없는 구조\n- [x] **단신 맞춤 저상형 규격**: 무릎 아래 23cm 안착\n- [ ] **마사지 롤러 탈부착**: 물때 방지 분리 세척 가능 여부 확인 필요 (구매 전 Q&A)","x":1125,"y":480,"width":490,"height":420,"color":"4"}
	],
